# assignment as everything else, so "Steroids" means the same set of patients
# here as it does in the survival section.
#
# THE COLUMN WAS RENAMED FIRST_YEAR_GROUP -> EXPOSURE_GROUP. At a 90-day
# landmark it is not a first-year group, and leaving the old name is how a
# results paragraph ends up describing the wrong exposure.
#
# STATUS: SECONDARY. This block is TRANSPLANT-anchored and is retained for
# comparability with the earlier version of the analysis. The primary version
# of this question is section 19b, which measures time from discharge to first
# post-discharge anti-rejection therapy using the full follow-up.
#
# DESIGN CAVEAT: exposure is fixed at the index admission but eligibility here
# requires surviving to YR2_ELIGIBLE_DAY. If treatment affects mortality in
# between, this conditions on a post-exposure variable and the odds ratios
